  "bio": "Stefano Marvulli is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in intricate dotwork, creating stunning, detailed designs that showcase his mastery of the style. Operating out of Pinerolo, Italy, Stefano not only brings the essence of Italian artistry to his work but also maintains an exemplary standard of cleanliness, ensuring a safe and hygienic environment for his clientele. His studio is a reflection of his professionalism, where clients can receive beautiful tattoos with peace of mind.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Pinerolo, Piedmont, Italy",
